{% doc %}
  @prompt
    # Valentine’s Day Shopify Theme – Design Documentation
    
    ## Project Overview
    
    This document outlines a **complete Valentine’s Day–themed Shopify homepage design**, structured into clear, editable sections. The theme is romantic, premium, and conversion-focused, specially suitable for **jewelry (rings for her)**. All sections are designed to be **merchant-editable from Shopify Theme Customizer** (no code dependency for daily edits).
    
    ---
    
    ## Section 1: Hero Banner (Valentine Special)
    
    ### Purpose
    
    Create a strong emotional first impression and immediately communicate Valentine’s gifting.
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Full-width hero banner
    * Desktop + Mobile responsive
    * Center-focused visual
    
    ### Visual Concept
    
    * **Animated GIF or short video**
    * Valentine elements:
    
      * Floating heart animation ❤️
      * Chocolate wrapper opening animation 🍫
      * Inside the heart: **a premium ring for her** 💍
    
    ### Content Elements
    
    * Main headline (editable text)
    
      * Example: *“A Ring That Says ‘I Love You’”*
    * Subheading (optional)
    
      * Example: *“This Valentine’s Day”*
    * Primary CTA button (editable)
    
      * Example: **Shop Valentine Collection**
    
    ### Shopify Settings (Editable)
    
    * Banner GIF / video upload
    * Heading text
    * Subheading text
    * CTA text + link
    * Overlay opacity
    
    ---
    
    ## Section 2: Auto-Scrolling Valentine Line (Right to Left)
    
    ### Purpose
    
    Add movement and luxury-brand feel while reinforcing Valentine messaging.
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Horizontal marquee / auto-scroll
    * Direction: **Right to Left**
    * Continuous loop
    
    ### Content
    
    * Repeating elements:
    
      * Ring icons
      * Small heart icons
      * Valentine phrases
    
    ### Example Text
    
    > 💍 Valentine Special • Made With Love • Perfect Gift For Her • Forever Starts Here • 💖
    
    ### Shopify Settings (Editable)
    
    * Enable / disable auto-scroll
    * Text content
    * Scroll speed
    * Icon selection
    * Background color
    * Text color
    
    ---
    
